; SteamMultiplayer stub export alias table.
; The Core resolves these exact (32-bit-mangled) names via GetProcAddress.
; Each is aliased to an undecorated extern "C" implementation in steam_stub.cpp.

EXPORTS
?SteamInit@@YAHXZ=SteamInitImpl
?SteamGetWorkshopItemPathDLL@@YAXPAD@Z=SteamGetWorkshopItemPathDLLImpl
?SteamIsWorkshopLoadingOnDLL@@YAHXZ=SteamIsWorkshopLoadingOnDLLImpl
